          <definition> To make crackling noises when eating</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠲᠣᠷᠴᠢᠺᠢᠨᠠᠲᠠᠯ᠎ᠠ ᠺᠡᠯᠡᠯᠴᠡᠺᠦ</unicode>
          <transcript>--tal-a kelelceky</transcript>
          <definition> To chatter with a crackling voice</definition>
        </example>
      </examples>
